/*!
\page page_stFmsPoint StFmsPoint

\brief Photon point reconstructed from an FMS cluster, with FPS pre-shower PID.

\section fmsPoint_overview Overview

StFmsPoint represents a single photon (or other EM particle) fitted to an
FMS lead-glass cluster (2.5 < η < 4.0).  Beyond position and four-momentum,
it carries FPS (Forward Pion Spectrometer) pre-shower layer hit patterns
that are used to classify the point as a photon, electron, MIP, or unknown
via the \c mFpsPid particle-ID flag.  Up to four candidate FPS slats per
layer are stored, sorted by projected distance from nearest to farthest.

\section fmsPoint_hierarchy Class Hierarchy

\code
TObject → StObject → StFmsPoint
\endcode

Stored in \ref page_stFmsCollection "StFmsCollection";
cross-linked to \ref page_stFmsCluster "StFmsCluster".

\section fmsPoint_members Data Members

| Type | Name | Description |
|---|---|---|
| UShort_t | mDetectorId | Sub-detector: 8=NLarge, 9=SLarge, 10=NSmall, 11=SSmall. |
| Float_t | mEnergy | Fitted photon energy [GeV]. |
| Float_t | mX | Local x-position [cm]. |
| Float_t | mY | Local y-position [cm]. |
| Int_t | mId | Event-wide photon ID. |
| Int_t | mParentClusterId | Parent cluster ID. |
| Int_t | mNParentClusterPhotons | Photon count in parent cluster. |
| StLorentzVectorF | mFourMomentum | Photon four-momentum. |
| StThreeVectorF | mXYZ | Global STAR position [cm]. |
| Int_t | mFpsPid | FPS PID classification (see StFmsPointPidFlag enum). |
| Int_t[3] | mFpsNCandidate | Candidate slat count per FPS layer. |
| Float_t[3][4] | mFpsMip | MIP signal per layer/candidate. |
| Int_t[3][4] | mFpsSlatId | Slat ID per layer/candidate. |
| Float_t[3][4] | mFpsDistance | Edge distance per layer/candidate. |

\section fmsPoint_pidflags FPS PID Flags (StFmsPointPidFlag)

| Value | Meaning |
|---|---|
| 0 | No FPS coverage |
| 10 | Non-converting photon (L1=L2=L3=0) |
| 11 | Golden photon (L3 hit only) |
| 20 | MIP (L1=L2=L3=1) |
| 30 | Golden electron (L1=L2=1, L3≥5) |

\section fmsPoint_methods Key Methods

- \c energy(), \c x(), \c y(), \c XYZ() — photon energy and position.
- \c fourMomentum() — four-momentum.
- \c detectorId(), \c id(), \c parentClusterId() — identification.
- \c cluster() — parent cluster.
- \c fpsPid(), \c fpsNCandidate(), \c fpsMip(), \c fpsSlatId(), \c fpsDistance() — FPS pre-shower data.
- \c setFps(), \c resetFps(), \c setFpsPid() — FPS setters.
- \c print() — print summary.

\section fmsPoint_seealso See Also

\ref page_stFmsCluster "StFmsCluster",
\ref page_stFmsPointPair "StFmsPointPair",
\ref page_stFpsSlat "StFpsSlat"
*/
